AA&oe=6A8AC40C"}, {"file_name": "10.png", "id": "930560302981583", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_930560306314916_4651222137203722591_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EJGShepHB_4Q7kNvwFD8MeH&_nc_oc=Ado0wSvlFbVkLCeMWF3h-Zm4hkHALSUkpe2gVPoEhb5q8BfZi8iHm-V1K6F8BlR2gyE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHQUNosHcwGmR8JiIKwuFkOL3pNistyp1p6HX3stMEIbg&oe=6A8AC331"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "806404989085980", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_806404992419313_5399097383898897472_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AQxIJJG_A-IQ7kNvwFXJEMs&_nc_oc=AdoeGcZyG5jAioyboGHVQPPHz-8dVtTfnht-07MIB6zBwWDDCW6Q0tZ8Lhpo-s8sXzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG7MjbB3CChv-XGj3KV2IUtFRh5OlXjpLCVyQDsd1a0lw&oe=6A8AEC0E"}, "display_name": "Fit River XR : Rowing Cardio Meditation", "keywords": ["Rowing", "Workout", "Cardio", "Fitness", "Nature"], "long_description": "# Embrace the Flow. Fit River XR.\n\nTrade the gym for a serene river. Fit River XR is a mindful rowing experience with no rhythms\u2014just you, the water, and your paddle.\n\n**Your Workout, Your Time**\n\nSet your timer to fit your day:\n\n* **3 Mins :** Quick mental reset.\n* **5 Mins :** Relaxing flow.\n* **7 Mins :** Deep immersion.\n\n**Choose Your Atmosphere**\n\nPick scenery to match your mood:\n\n* **Morning:** Fresh mist.\n* **Evening:** Peaceful sunset.\n* **Night:** Moonlit stillness.\n\n**Real Results**\n\nEngage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low-impact cardio that is rewarding for your soul.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n* **Scenic Focus:** Pure nature.\n* **Flexible Timers:** 3, 5, or 7 mins.\n* **Atmospheric Modes:** Morning, Evening, and Night.\n* **Stats:** Real-time distance and calorie tracking.\n\n**Find your flow today with Fit River XR .**\n", "sh